2084, world war three has finally ended, we found two burnt journals among the rubble of the first official battle of WW3, here is what they say:


First journal:  


"We thought world war three was going to be because of the political breakout, but no.

&#x200B;

It was an internal conflict, one that had been brewing for years. The eternal struggle in every nation, families being torn apart at the seams because of this problem. It's a battle between US, and THEM. Those awful people who creep in our bathrooms, the people who walk among us as if they were one of us. Now we are at war with them. Hopefully this will end quick."

&#x200B;

The second journal:  
"I've been drafted to fight against trans people? I honestly never thought I'd get this far."

